   115→
   116→/**
   117→ * Apply temporal degradation to detection effectiveness
   118→ *
   119→ * Research-skeptic revision:
   120→ * - CoT monitoring: -15%/year decline (faster than original -10%/year)
   121→ * - Neural probes: -10%/year decline (adversarial evasion)
